  "//versions": "next/react/react-dom are pinned EXACTLY. Every v2 package peers react ^18.2.0 and react-konva@18.2.x is the React-18 line; two React copies is a hard crash in Konva's reconciler, not a warning. These exact versions are already in the lockfile, so this app adds no new resolutions.",
